=[ tomet-extract-rust ]

Extraction of Tomet API documentation from Rust crates using `syn`.

This crate parses Rust source files with `syn`, traverses crate and module
hierarchies, inspects item visibilities (`pub`), and extracts documentation
comments (`//!` and `///`).

Because doc comments are assumed to be written in Tomet markup syntax,
extracted comments are parsed into Tomet AST [`tomet_ast::Document`] blocks,
creating a unified `.tmt` document for each Rust crate.

==[ Module extract ]

===[ Structs ]

====[ struct RustExtractOptions ]

Options controlling extraction of Rust code documentation.

====[ struct RustCrateSource ]

In-memory representation of a Rust crate source code.

===[ Functions ]

====[ fn extract_file_doc ]

Extracts documentation for a single Rust source code string into a Tomet [`Document`].

====[ fn extract_crate_doc ]

Extracts documentation from an entire Rust crate into a single unified Tomet [`Document`].
